    <string name="home_tip_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="home_tip_body">1. Open your manhwa in any reader app.\n2. Tap the floating ManhwaLens bubble.\n3. The current screen is captured on-device and speech bubbles are translated instantly.\n\nNothing leaves your phone: OCR and translation run locally.</string>
